## Key Insight

One of the biggest insights I discovered was that recruiters don't spend much time reading a resume.

They look for:

* Impact
* Clarity
* Relevance
* Measurable achievements

I learned that a strong personal brand is not just about listing skills. It is about clearly communicating value and demonstrating results.

